{
    "title": "Credit Sesame",
    "description": "Credit Sesame is an all-in-one credit score management app designed to improve your credit and your financial health. Our platform empowers you to access, understand & build your credit and manage its growth and protection. \r\n\r\nWe analyze your credit profile to find the best offers for credit cards and other credit products that match your needs making it easier for you to take the next steps in your financial journey.\r\n\r\nWhether your goal is to improve your credit score, repair your credit or secure your dream home, Credit Sesame is your trusted partner in achieving your credit goals. Be wise and elevate your credit and fiscal wellness today with Credit Sesame\u2019s features like:\r\n\r\n\u25b6 Get your Free Credit Score\r\nCredit Sesame refreshes your credit score daily, so you can stay up to date on your TransUnion credit score anytime, anywhere.  Check your credit score, and monitor your daily progress! Understand what is influencing your credit score and get unique insights & tips on how to improve it.\r\n\r\n\u25b6 Credit Report Summary & Sesame Grade\r\nGet a weekly breakdown of your credit report and learn about the factors that impact your credit. You'll receive a straightforward letter grade reflecting the five key components affecting your credit score, helping you manage and improve your credit score more effectively. \r\n\r\n\u25b6 Free Credit Alerts & Credit Monitoring\r\nMake smarter moves with intelligent & real- time credit alerts! Stay informed about changes in your credit report & credit factors and safeguard your credit score from unexpected changes.\r\n\r\n\u25b6 See Your Credit Score Potential\r\nYou want the highest credit score possible\u2014and we\u2019re here to help you get it. Learn how the actions you take now can influence your future credit score. Along with seeing your potential score, receive customized advice and actionable steps to enhance your credit.\r\n\r\n\u25b6 DISCLOSURES\r\nELIGIBILITY AND ADDITIONAL DETAILS; PERSONAL LOAN INTEREST RATES AND FEES. You can see personal loan offers on the Credit Sesame personal loan marketplace from third party advertisers from which Credit Sesame receives compensation. Offers have rates that range from 1.99% APR to 35.99% APR with terms from 1 to 10 years. Rates are subject to change without notice and are controlled by our third party advertisers, not Credit Sesame. Depending on the particular lender, other fees may apply, such as origination fees or late payment fees. See the particular lender's terms and conditions for additional details. All loan offers on Credit Sesame require your application and approval by the lender. You may not qualify for a personal loan at all or you may not qualify for the lowest rates or the highest offer amounts.\r\nPERSONAL LOAN REPAYMENT EXAMPLE. The following example assumes a $15,000 personal loan with a four year (48 month) term. For APRs ranging from 1.99% to 35.99%, monthly payments would range from $338 to $594. Assuming all of the 48 payments are made on-time, the total amount paid would range from $16,212 to $28,492.\r\n\r\n\r\nJoin over 18 million members who are maximizing their credit potential with Credit Sesame. Don't let karma decide your financial health, start making informed decisions and taking control of your financial future today!\r\n\r\nFor more information:\r\n\r\nAll Policies: https://www.creditsesame.com/legal/policies/\r\nCustomer Service: help@creditsesame.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Credit Sesame is an all-in-one credit score management app designed to improve your credit and your financial health. Our platform empowers you to access, understand &amp; build your credit and manage its growth and protection. <br><br>We analyze your credit profile to find the best offers for credit cards and other credit products that match your needs making it easier for you to take the next steps in your financial journey.<br><br>Whether your goal is to improve your credit score, repair your credit or secure your dream home, Credit Sesame is your trusted partner in achieving your credit goals. Be wise and elevate your credit and fiscal wellness today with Credit Sesame\u2019s features like:<br><br>\u25b6 Get your Free Credit Score<br>Credit Sesame refreshes your credit score daily, so you can stay up to date on your TransUnion credit score anytime, anywhere.  Check your credit score, and monitor your daily progress! Understand what is influencing your credit score and get unique insights &amp; tips on how to improve it.<br><br>\u25b6 Credit Report Summary &amp; Sesame Grade<br>Get a weekly breakdown of your credit report and learn about the factors that impact your credit. You&#39;ll receive a straightforward letter grade reflecting the five key components affecting your credit score, helping you manage and improve your credit score more effectively. <br><br>\u25b6 Free Credit Alerts &amp; Credit Monitoring<br>Make smarter moves with intelligent &amp; real- time credit alerts! Stay informed about changes in your credit report &amp; credit factors and safeguard your credit score from unexpected changes.<br><br>\u25b6 See Your Credit Score Potential<br>You want the highest credit score possible\u2014and we\u2019re here to help you get it. Learn how the actions you take now can influence your future credit score. Along with seeing your potential score, receive customized advice and actionable steps to enhance your credit.<br><br>\u25b6 DISCLOSURES<br>ELIGIBILITY AND ADDITIONAL DETAILS; PERSONAL LOAN INTEREST RATES AND FEES. You can see personal loan offers on the Credit Sesame personal loan marketplace from third party advertisers from which Credit Sesame receives compensation. Offers have rates that range from 1.99% APR to 35.99% APR with terms from 1 to 10 years. Rates are subject to change without notice and are controlled by our third party advertisers, not Credit Sesame. Depending on the particular lender, other fees may apply, such as origination fees or late payment fees. See the particular lender&#39;s terms and conditions for additional details. All loan offers on Credit Sesame require your application and approval by the lender. You may not qualify for a personal loan at all or you may not qualify for the lowest rates or the highest offer amounts.<br>PERSONAL LOAN REPAYMENT EXAMPLE. The following example assumes a $15,000 personal loan with a four year (48 month) term. For APRs ranging from 1.99% to 35.99%, monthly payments would range from $338 to $594. Assuming all of the 48 payments are made on-time, the total amount paid would range from $16,212 to $28,492.<br><br><br>Join over 18 million members who are maximizing their credit potential with Credit Sesame. Don&#39;t let karma decide your financial health, start making informed decisions and taking control of your financial future today!<br><br>For more information:<br><br>All Policies: https://www.creditsesame.com/legal/policies/<br>Customer Service: help@creditsesame.com",
